    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Founded 2007 by Mike Alderson and Tim Swift in London (Shoreditch); majority stake acquired by WPP's Landor in 2015, now part of the Landor & Fitch group. Dual studios in London (Norway Wharf) and Los Angeles (Gilroy St). Approx 60 employees (LinkedIn; aggregators 60-69). Work spans CGI-heavy motion, brand identity, broadcast design, commercials and film direction; clients include Apple, Nike, Adidas, Netflix, Spotify, Volvo, BBC, Channel 4. Multiple Cannes Gold Lion awards. Studio entity with 17+ years of senior creative output at the top of motion and identity design; represents Autonomy 5 as a studio. Capabilities: 3D & motion (jonathan) is confirmed; evidence also supports Creative direction, Film & video production, Identity systems (broadcast and brand systems), and Graphic design from mvsm.com project pages and press coverage. Proposed expansion via Open Questions. Work Status Studio confirmed; Country expanded UK + US per dual-office evidence.",
